title: dsh-memgas
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper its retrieval method
  is based on.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Xu
    given-names: Derong
abstract: >-
  Long-term memory plugin for DeepSeek Harness: multi-channel retrieval
  with rank fusion, and a background evolution loop that reconciles,
  reinforces, decays and abstracts stored memories.
